<p>Creates a circle of radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 3, 4, 4</acronym> at your feet; the circle slows incoming projectiles by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">55%, 74%, 89%, 101%, 112%</acronym> and attempts to push all creatures other than yourself out of its radius, inflicting <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">11, 15, 18, 20, 23</acronym> light damage and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">11, 15, 18, 20, 23</acronym> darkness damage per turn as it does so.  The circle lasts <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 5, 6, 7, 8</acronym> turns.</p><p>The effects will increase with your Spellpower.</p>